    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An Ideal opportunity to acquire a stunning 3 bedroom semi-detached with attic conversion in a mature established residential area. The accommodation briefly comprises porch, lounge with built in electric fire and light-filled kitchen/dining area with double doors to rear garden. Upstairs there is a family bathroom, 3 bedrooms and an attic conversion. With a new kitchen and tastefully decorated throughout, this fine property also boasts off street parking to the front and a maintenance-free rear garden. \r\n\r\n15 Grange Abbey Grove is located in this highly sought after area with a host of amenities on your doorstep. Baldoyle Village and Howth Junction Dart Station are minutes’ walk away.\r\n\r\nOther local services and amenities include Clarehall & Donaghmede Shopping Centre, a selection of secondary schools, Trinity Sports Centre and the Malahide bus corridor. Easy access is provided to the M1, M50 motorways and Dublin Airport. This property is presented in walk in condition and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch\t1.16 x .82\tDecorative timber floor \r\n\t\t\r\nLounge\t5.23 x 4.23\tDecorative timber floor, spot lights, built in electric fire, double doors to kitchen\r\n\t\t\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\t3.49 x 5.24\tTiled floor, fully fitted kitchen, oven, built-in microwave, hob, extractor fan, dishwasher, upgraded quartz worktop and splashback, washing machine, radiator cover, recess lights \r\n\t\t\r\nFirst Floor\t\r\n\t\t\r\nStairs/Landing\t\tHot press, decorative timber floor\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1 (master)\t3.20 x 3.25\tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobes, TV point, blinds\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t3.81 x 2.70\tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobes, blinds\r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom\t1.93 x 1.83\tTiled floor & walls, spot lights, w.c, w.h.b with cabinet, standalone electric shower, heated towel rail\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 3\t2.83 x 2.44\tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobes, blinds\r\n\t\t\r\nAttic Room\t3.78 x 3.60\tDecorative timber floor, skylight, eave storage \r\n\t\t\r\nGarden\r\n\t\r\nFront\tCobblelock driveway, flower beds, private off street parking, walled & railed \r\n\r\nRear\tPart lawn, walled and fenced, patio area, garden shed, outdoor lighting"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tSIDE ACCESS\r\n•\tMODERN KITCHEN\r\n•\tMINUTES WALK TO DART STATION\r\n•\tATTIC CONVERSION\r\n•\tOFF STREET PARKING\r\n•\tGASL-FIRED CENTRAL HEATING \r\n•\tCLOSE TO A NUMBER OF AMENITIES\r\n•\tWALK IN CONDITION"
